<div class="sc-merchant-form"><h2>Sola / Cardknox</h2><p>Connect this business’s own merchant account. Its private transaction key stays encrypted on the server; only its public iFields key is used by the secure card fields.</p>
  <% if(cardknoxAccount.connected){ %><p role="status"><%= cardknoxAccount.chargesEnabled?'Connected and available for customer payment links.':'Account verified. Payment activation is not enabled on this installation yet.' %></p><% } %>
  <% if(currentUser.role==='owner'){ %><form method="post" action="/settings/connections/cardknox" class="stack-form" data-busy><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
   <label>Private transaction API key<input name="apiKey" type="password" maxlength="250" autocomplete="off" required></label><label>Public iFields key<input name="ifieldsKey" maxlength="250" autocomplete="off" required></label>
   <label>Merchant environment<select name="testMode"><option value="true">Sola sandbox / test merchant</option><option value="false">Live merchant</option></select></label><p>This setting does not convert a live key into a test key. Use keys issued for the chosen merchant environment.</p><button class="rm-btn" type="submit">Verify and connect Sola</button></form>
   <% if(cardknoxAccount.connected){ %><form method="post" action="/settings/connections/cardknox/disconnect"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="rm-btn rm-btn--ghost">Disconnect Sola</button></form><% } %>
  <% } %></div>